+# M8-04 implementation and evaluation report
+
+Date: 2026-10-06. Delivery status: **DONE_WITH_CONCERNS for the scoped implementation/evaluation slice; the M8-04 task and acceptance gates remain open.** Physical and Windows requirements remain NOT RUN, not passing. No compatibility matrix row is promoted.
+
+Review base: `4a915eacb41f15bd54cb4617df08b4c181222f6a`. Product/test/fixture revision tested: **`29be4123ad812e66d26d225b899a46fa9b5d233d`** (`feat(ftc): evaluate controller endpoints and scoped forwarding`). This report and captured outputs are a subsequent documentation-only commit; no product changes follow the tested revision.
+
+## Scope and decisions
+
+Implemented additive `Adb.ForwardTransport`/`forwardPanels`, injected `Panels.ReadTransport`/`readEndpoints`, and canonical serializable `FtcController.EndpointError`/`ProtocolEvidence`. Existing M8-01 candidate, error, discovery parsing and `Controllers.layer(transport)` are unchanged. No public Protocol/HttpApi, manifest, lockfile, generated client, registration, composition, shared checklist or coordinator ledger edits are part of this delivery.
+
+Used Superpowers TDD and its test guidance for executable behavior; coordinator owns independent review. Rulings: use the existing assigned checkout, no subagents/shared ledger writes, run affected tests rather than an unrelated Core blanket suite, and retain unavailable physical checks as open gates. These follow the dispatch brief's explicit constraints. Resource decoders implement only the minimal source-backed subset; no claimed safe dashboard fallback is fabricated from bidirectional forwards.
+
+See [controller protocol](controller-protocol.md) for exact source versions, routes, resource limitations, identity/log unknowns, M9/M10 handoff, and required real-platform matrix. The prior [source preflight](M8-04-source-preflight.md) was reused; no source rediscovery/download was performed.
+
+## Reproducible environment and commands
+
+Host: macOS 26.5.2 (25F84), arm64. Bun 1.3.14 (`0d9b296a`); Effect 4.0.0-beta.83; provisioned workspace dependencies unchanged. All commands below prepend:
+
+```sh
+export PATH=/private/tmp/ftc-bun-1.3.14/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH
+```
+
+No real controller, Windows host, APK, production ADB forward, Electron dashboard or mutation authorization is supplied. ADB version is prior-audit information, not freshly executed; only its binary SHA-256 was read. Upstream source archive and license provenance are retained in [fixture provenance](../../packages/core/test/ftc-adapters/fixtures/controller-endpoints/provenance.md).
