+| Missing vs zero/freshness                    | Empty/zero/sentinel values preserved; absent sample omitted; freshness always unknown                                                                                                               | Does not attach robot/project, invent time or declare stale samples fresh. M10 integration needed.                                             |
+| Independent data from dashboard              | Reads use explicit data origin; dashboard stays blocked irrespective of resource success                                                                                                            | PAN-02 preparation only; no live telemetry acceptance.                                                                                         |
+| No regressions / dependencies                | M8-01 plus M9-07 affected selection; Core/Schema typechecks; scoped lint/format                                                                                                                     | No composition or generated client change. Tests never run from repo root.                                                                     |
+| Manual/physical matrix                       | Five explicit evaluation skips; detailed unavailable rows in protocol report                                                                                                                        | Control Hub/phone USB/Wi-Fi, Windows, actual logs/freshness/build association/dashboard mediation remain **NOT RUN**.                          |
+| Review and completion                        | Focused product commit and this evidence; coordinator reviews range from stated base                                                                                                                | Shared task completion checkboxes deliberately untouched; full M8-04 cannot close on fixture evidence.                                         |
+
+## Limitations for the next owners
+
+The adapter recognizes resource metadata for Telemetry/Battery/OpModeControl/Configurables/CameraStream but only decodes core/time, textual telemetry and finite battery samples. Other incoming frames fail closed, not silently become telemetry. Unknown/custom plugins and Limelight routes are not followed. Plugin hash equality never identifies a physical robot. Full dashboard resources, upstream JS execution, no-replay of real controls and external fallback are unverified.
+
+`ReadTransport` and `ForwardTransport` are narrow injected boundaries, not production network/ADB implementations. Any future host must prove bounded I/O, cancellation, acquisition compensation, exclusive lease ownership and response mediation before registration. A raw forward accepts traffic in both directions and cannot be used as a read-only capability. Fixed frontend port 8002 makes arbitrary-port dashboard forwarding insufficient. No approval, deployment/start/tuning, sibling module access or automatic replay was introduced.
